*swrite* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''swrite(data, handle)''

Writes data to a socket connection.

*Parameters:*
- ''data'': Bytes data to write
- ''handle'': Socket handle

*Returns:*
- Number: Number of bytes written
- ''err'' on failure

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if data is not bytes
- Runtime error if handle is not a number
- Runtime error if handle is invalid socket handle
- Runtime error if socket connection is closed
- Runtime error if trying to write to listening socket
